WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:06.333
The anime caused a social phenomenon.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:11.466
It is a reboot that hardcore fans have been waiting for a long time.

00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:17.033
Please do enjoy this anime together with the movie series.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:18.500
Ta-da!

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:20.700
Hi, it's N-ko!

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.633
This week's The N-ko Show has started!

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:27.733
Today, I'd like to talk a bit about

00:00:27.733 --> 00:00:32.200
the American anime I watched when I was little.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:39.066
Cartoon Network, Nickelodeon, and Disney Channel are the three main channels

00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:42.766
that broadcast anime for children.

00:00:42.766 --> 00:00:46.866
And there's another one, similar to Japan's NHK,

00:00:46.866 --> 00:00:51.233
which has educational shows. I watched that as well.

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:53.700
Among them, I absolutely loved...

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.666
if I were to give an example of anime streamed on Netflix,

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:58.733
it was AVATAR, AIRBENDER.

00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:00.866
I absolutely loved it.

00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:05.000
American anime is similar to Japanese anime.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.066
Each episode is a complete story,

00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:12.200
but they somehow develop into a big story.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.900
You can enjoy it if you miss some episodes,

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:18.633
but you'll also enjoy it if you watch it every week.

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:20.366
Many anime are like that.

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:24.400
Well then, let's start this week's The N-ko Show!

00:01:29.066 --> 00:01:34.300
I will share my recommendations based on my personal preference again.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.866
This is the theme.

00:01:36.733 --> 00:01:39.166
Try to expand your world!

00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:42.666
Overseas anime you will surely get hooked on!

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.333
Many anime originate in Japan,

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:52.833
but many interesting anime are being made all over the world now!

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:58.533
This time, if you haven't watched overseas anime before,

00:01:58.533 --> 00:02:01.200
and if you don't know them at all,

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.533
I'll recommend some to you.

00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:06.433
First, it's this anime.

00:02:06.433 --> 00:02:07.533
WAKFU.

00:02:07.533 --> 00:02:12.666
This is a television anime produced in France,

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:17.466
it's a fantasy anime based on its original video game.

00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:21.366
Yugo, whose blue hood is his trademark,

00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:26.300
belongs to the species closest to the gods who created the world,

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:30.966
Eliatrope, which is a rare species.

00:02:30.966 --> 00:02:35.833
A catastrophe occurred in the world shortly after he was born,

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.966
so he was adopted by

00:02:37.966 --> 00:02:42.066
a man called Alibert, together with the message he was entrusted with.

00:02:42.066 --> 00:02:46.833
Yugo lives peacefully with Alibert,

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:51.300
but a certain incident causes his special power to awaken.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:56.233
When Alibert sees Yugo's special power,

00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:58.900
he recalls the message he was entrusted with

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:03.800
and tells Yugo to go on a journey to look for his real family.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.400
And the story goes on.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.933
That's the abstract of the story.

00:03:08.933 --> 00:03:14.233
I especially recommend it to people who are used to watching Japanese anime.

00:03:14.233 --> 00:03:20.333
The cute and adorable character designs are excellent.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:23.800
The illustrations of battle scenes are also overwhelming.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:28.033
It's easy to enter the world of this anime.

00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:34.866
Many anime fans call this a great anime, so please do watch it.

00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:36.700
Next, it's this anime.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:37.833
VOLTRON: LEGENDARY DEFENDER.

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:42.133
It was co-produced by America and Korea.

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:47.466
Lion robots are piloted by five warriors, the Paladins,

00:03:47.466 --> 00:03:53.466
and they combine to form the strongest warrior, Voltron.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:56.466
The five Paladins use it to confront

00:03:56.466 --> 00:04:00.100
the Galra Empire, which is a threat to the universe,

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:04.800
in this grand space robot action anime.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:10.800
It was originally a reboot of the popular American anime, VOLTRON,

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.900
which cause a social phenomenon mainly among

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.000
children in America at that time.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:22.133
So it is a reboot that hardcore fans have been waiting for a long time.

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:26.233
Of course, even people who don't know the social phenomenon at that time

00:04:26.233 --> 00:04:28.700
can thoroughly enjoy this anime,

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:33.300
whose action scenes are the best!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.533
As a matter of fact,

00:04:34.533 --> 00:04:38.833
DreamWorks Animation is part of the production team.

00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:42.200
They've produced prominent series,

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:46.766
like the KUNG FU PANDA series and the SHREK series.

00:04:46.766 --> 00:04:51.866
Their overwhelming abilities of illustration and representation are impeccable,

00:04:51.866 --> 00:04:55.066
and you'll surely get caught up in the anime.

00:04:55.066 --> 00:04:59.200
I especially recommend this anime to robot fans,

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.166
so please do watch it.

00:05:01.166 --> 00:05:03.200
Next, it's this anime.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.000
THE MIDNIGHT GOSPEL.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.600
Spacecaster, Clancy, uses a simulator

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:14.533
to go to parallel universes that are in various crises of destruction

00:05:14.533 --> 00:05:18.100
and interviews the people there.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:22.833
It's an anime produced by America and each episode is independent.

00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:28.200
It is difficult to tell you the abstract of the anime's throughline,

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.300
but as to the most special feature of this anime,

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:36.600
the stories were written based on podcast interviews by

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:42.166
Mr. Duncan Trussell, who plays the protagonist, Clancy.

00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:46.833
Mr. Pendleton Ward, the original creator of this anime,

00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:54.200
had the idea of animating the contents of Mr. Trussell's podcast interviews

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.866
and they produced this anime.

00:05:56.866 --> 00:05:59.166
The script is good,

00:05:59.166 --> 00:06:03.700
the drawings are psychedelic, and it's a bit grotesque,

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:06.100
but the contents are humorous,

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:10.366
and the anime is just like a podcast you can watch.

00:06:10.366 --> 00:06:12.866
It goes beyond the limits of anime so far.

00:06:12.866 --> 00:06:15.933
Everything depicted is new,

00:06:15.933 --> 00:06:20.500
so you'll surely get addicted to it after you watch it once.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.433
Next, it's this anime.

00:06:23.433 --> 00:06:25.633
RICK AND MORTY.

00:06:25.633 --> 00:06:28.633
Rick, a drunk genius scientist,

00:06:28.633 --> 00:06:30.866
brings his grandson Morty along

00:06:30.866 --> 00:06:34.100
to travel to various dimensions and worlds.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:38.533
It's a comedy about the troubles that occur at their destinations.

00:06:38.533 --> 00:06:41.966
Like the typical anime produced in America,

00:06:41.966 --> 00:06:44.700
it has deformed character designs,

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.666
and it's full of black humor with an edge of satire.

00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:54.600
So I recommend the anime to all age groups, from adults to children.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:59.333
How Morty is at the mercy of Rick's craziness

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:01.766
is one of the great charms of this anime.

00:07:01.766 --> 00:07:04.433
Typical American comedies

00:07:04.433 --> 00:07:09.233
often turn movies or actual incidents into funny parodies

00:07:09.233 --> 00:07:12.400
and present them in a comical way.

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:18.133
But in many cases, we don't know where the stories come from, right?

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:24.000
In this anime, most of the ideas are derived from pop culture.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.266
Famous scenes that everyone would have seen

00:07:27.266 --> 00:07:29.866
are turned into parodies everywhere,

00:07:29.866 --> 00:07:33.100
so even if you don't know much about movies and anime,

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.933
you'll find this anime funny.

00:07:35.933 --> 00:07:41.600
I recommend it to people who want to casually enjoy overseas anime.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.966
The last one is this.

00:07:43.966 --> 00:07:47.166
JURASSIC WORLD CAMP CRETACEOUS.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:52.933
This is a computer graphics anime produced by DreamWorks Animation.

00:07:52.933 --> 00:07:57.700
It is a sci-fi anime that depicts the world of the famous movies,

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.133
the JURASSIC PARK series.

00:08:00.133 --> 00:08:03.366
The stage is the one also featured in the movies,

00:08:03.366 --> 00:08:07.466
Isla Nublar, the island where dinosaurs live.

00:08:07.466 --> 00:08:11.566
When six children go to the campsite,

00:08:11.566 --> 00:08:14.466
can they run away from the dinosaurs that are out of control,

00:08:14.466 --> 00:08:16.733
and escape from the island?

00:08:16.733 --> 00:08:18.933
This is the abstract.

00:08:18.933 --> 00:08:22.766
Surprisingly, this is the first anime produced

00:08:22.766 --> 00:08:26.933
as based on the JURASSIC PARK series.

00:08:26.933 --> 00:08:28.966
Besides anime fans,

00:08:28.966 --> 00:08:32.866
movie fans should check out this anime too.

00:08:32.866 --> 00:08:35.800
It's linked to incidents that happen in the movies,

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:40.833
and it's closely related to the incidents portrayed in

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:43.366
JURASSIC WORLD, which was released in 2015.

00:08:43.366 --> 00:08:48.933
Please do enjoy this anime together with the movie series.

00:08:48.933 --> 00:08:52.666
All the anime I introduced today are unique,

00:08:52.666 --> 00:08:56.600
and you will surely get hooked on them.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.633
Please do watch them.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.433
That's it for Weekly Favorites.

