00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:09.900
I heard many rumors in 2017 that this anime was amazing,

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.066
but for some reason, I didn't see it.

00:10:12.066 --> 00:10:14.966
I missed the chance to watch it.

00:10:14.966 --> 00:10:17.533
Like the way the broomsticks are shaped,

00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:20.433
the anime's world view is unique,

00:10:20.433 --> 00:10:24.400
and the costume of each character has particular details.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:31.266
I can feel that the anime's world is elaborate just by looking at its website.

00:10:31.266 --> 00:10:33.933
I do want to watch it.

00:10:33.933 --> 00:10:36.366
Thank you for recommending it.

00:10:36.366 --> 00:10:40.466
